This repository contains a copy of the "depthai-experiments" repository,
whose source is now "https://github.com/luxonis/oak-examples" and is in
a much different state than when development on this project began. The
corresponding subdirectory contains its MIT license--the same license as
this project--and exists to preserve existing functionality from the
Electron app and environment setup logic. The corresponding .git folder
for this logic was removed in this copy.

Future versions of this application should utilize the modern OAK
libraries with correct flags, and remove the `depthai-experiments`
subdirectory when possible (as it is very significant in size).
